sults</span></div><div class="cardBody donutWrap"><svg viewBox="0 0 168 168" role="img" aria-label="Positive 49.9%, Neutral 30.2%, Negative 19.9%"><circle cx="84" cy="84" r="62" fill="none" stroke="#60FF80" stroke-width="28" stroke-dasharray="194.2881179620569 195.26937108307743" stroke-dashoffset="0" transform="rotate(-90 84 84)"></circle><circle cx="84" cy="84" r="62" fill="none" stroke="#FFFC60" stroke-width="28" stroke-dasharray="117.75037452245874 271.8071145226756" stroke-dashoffset="-194.2881179620569" transform="rotate(-90 84 84)"></circle><circle cx="84" cy="84" r="62" fill="none" stroke="#FF4444" stroke-width="28" stroke-dasharray="77.51899656061867 312.03849248451564" stroke-dashoffset="-312.03849248451564" transform="rotate(-90 84 84)"></circle><text class="tFg" x="84" y="84" font-size="22" font-weight="800" text-anchor="middle">397</text><text class="tMuted" x="84" y="102" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle">results</text></svg><ul class="legend"><li><span class="sw" style="background: rgb(96, 255, 128);"></span><span>Positive <span class="mutedText">(198)</span></span><span class="num">49.9%</span><span class="chg"><span class="flat">n/a vs Sep report</span></span></li><li><span class="sw" style="background: rgb(255, 252, 96);"></span><span>Neutral <span class="mutedText">(120)</span></span><span class="num">30.2%</span><span class="chg"><span class="flat">n/a vs Sep report</span></span></li><li><span class="sw" style="background: rgb(255, 68, 68);"></span><span>Negative <span class="mutedText">(79)</span></span><span class="num">19.9%</span><span class="chg"><span class="flat">n/a vs Sep report</span></span></li></ul></div></div><div class="card" data-export-block=""><div class="cardHead"><h3>Without brand-owned channels</h3><span class="meta">15 results</span></div><div class="cardBody donutWrap"><svg viewBox="0 0 168 168" role="img" aria-label="Positive 46.7%, Neutral 33.3%, Negative 20%"><circle cx="84" cy="84" r="62" fill="none" stroke="#60FF80" s