iv><div class="hrow"><div class="lab" title="Reddit">Reddit<span>132</span></div><div class="hbar" role="img" aria-label="Reddit: Positive 66, Neutral 40, Negative 26"><i style="width: 50%; background: rgb(96, 255, 128);" title="Positive: 66">50%</i><i style="width: 30.303030303030305%; background: rgb(255, 252, 96);" title="Neutral: 40">30%</i><i style="width: 19.696969696969695%; background: rgb(255, 68, 68);" title="Negative: 26">20%</i></div></div><div class="hrow"><div class="lab" title="News">News<span>67</span></div><div class="hbar" role="img" aria-label="News: Positive 33, Neutral 20, Negative 14"><i style="width: 49.25373134328358%; background: rgb(96, 255, 128);" title="Positive: 33">49%</i><i style="width: 29.850746268656717%; background: rgb(255, 252, 96);" title="Neutral: 20">30%</i><i style="width: 20.895522388059703%; background: rgb(255, 68, 68);" title="Negative: 14">21%</i></div></div></div><div class="key"><span><i style="background: rgb(96, 255, 128);"></i>Positive</span><span><i style="background: rgb(255, 252, 96);"></i>Neutral</span><span><i style="background: rgb(255, 68, 68);"></i>Negative</span></div></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="secHead"><h2>Year to date</h2><span>Earlier months as presented in each month's report; October from this export</span></div><div class="card" data-export-block=""><div class="cardHead"><h3>Sentiment, October</h3><span class="meta">% of results</span></div><div class="cardBody"><svg viewBox="0 0 960 250" role="img" aria-label="Brand sentiment by month, October"><rect x="448" y="115" width="64" height="106" rx="3" style="fill: #60FF80;"></rect><text class="tSeg" x="480" y="172.5" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle">50</text><rect x="448" y="50.8" width="64" height="63.2" rx="3" style="fill: #FFFC60;"></rect><text class="tSeg" x="480" y="86.9" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle">30</text><rect x="448" y="8" width="64" height="41.8" rx="3" style="fill: #FF4444;"></rect><text class="tSeg" x="480" y="33.4" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle">20</text><text class="tMuted" x="480" y="242" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="800">Oct</text></svg><div class="key"><span><i style="background: rgb(96, 255, 128);"></i>Positive</span><span><i style="background: rgb(255, 252, 96);"></i>Neutral</span><span><i style="background: rgb(255, 68, 68);"></i>Negative</span></div></div></div><div class="grid g2"><div class="card" data-export-block=""><div class="cardHead"><h3>Positive + neutral combined</h3><span class="meta">% of results</span></div><div class="cardBody"><svg viewBox="0 0 480 240" role="img" aria-label="Positive + neutral: Oct 80%; Negative: Oct 20%"><line class="gridLine" x1="34" x2="464" y1="212" y2="212"></line><text class="tMuted" x="28" y="216" font-size="11" text-anchor="end">0%</text><line class="gridLine" x1="34" x2="464" y1="164.5" y2="164.5"></line><text class="tMuted" x="28" y="168.5" font-size="11" text-anchor="end">25%</text><line class="gridLine" x1="34" x2="464" y1="117" y2="117"></line><text class="tMuted" x="28" y="121" font-size="11" text-anchor="end">50%</text><line class="gridLine" x1="34" x2="464" y1="69.5" y2="69.5"></line><text class="tMuted" x="28" y="73.5" font-size="11" text-anchor="end">75%</text><line class="gridLine" x1="34" x2="464" y1="22" y2="22"></line><text class="tMuted" x="28" y="26" font-size="11" text-anchor="end">100%</text><text class="tMuted" x="249" y="232" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="800">Oct</text><polyline points="249,59.99999999999999" fill="none" stroke="#60FF80" stroke-width="2.5"></polyline><circle cx="249" cy="59.99999999999999" r="4" fill="#60FF80" stroke="#272727" stroke-width="2"></circle><text class="tFg" x="249" y="49.99999999999999" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">80</text><polyline points="249,174" fill="none" stroke="#FF4444" stroke-width="2.5"></polyline><circle cx="249" cy="174" r="4" fill="#FF4444" stroke="#272727" stroke-width="2"></circle><text class="tFg" x="249" y="192" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">20</text></svg><div class="key"><span><i style="background: rgb(96, 255, 128);"></i>Positive + neutral</span><span><i style="background: rgb(255, 68, 68);"></i>Negative</span></div></div></div><div class="card" data-export-block=""><div class="cardHead"><h3>Reddit sentiment</h3><span class="meta">% of Reddit results</span></div><div class="cardBody"><svg viewBox="0 0 960 250" role="img" aria-label="Reddit sentiment by month"><rect x="448" y="115" width="64" height="106" rx="3" style="fill: #60FF80;"></rect><text class="tSeg" x="480" y="172.5" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle">50</text><rect x="448" y="50.8" width="64" height="63.2" rx="3" style="fill: #FFFC60;"></rect><text class="tSeg" x="480" y="86.9" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle">30</text><rect x="448" y="8" width="64" height="41.8" rx="3" style="fill: #FF4444;"></rect><text class="tSeg" x="480" y="33.4" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle">20</text><text class="tMuted" x="480" y="242" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="800">Oct</text></svg><div class="key"><span><i style="background: rgb(96, 255, 128);"></i>Positive</span><span><i style="background: rgb(255, 252, 96);"></i>Neutral</span><span><i style="background: rgb(255, 68, 68);"></i>Negative</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section"><h2>Media types</h2><div class="card" data-export-block=""><div class="cardHead"><h3>Share of media types</h3><span class="meta">Change vs the September export</span></div><div class="cardBody"><div><div class="mhead"><span>Media type</span><span>Share</span><span>%</span><span>Change</span></div><div class="mrow"><span class="lab" title="Instagram">Instagram <span>198</span></span><span class="track"><i style="width: 100%;"></i></span><span class="pct">49.9%</span><span class="chg"><span class="flat">n/a</span></span></div><div class="mrow"><span class="lab" title="Reddit">Reddit <span>132</span></span><span class="track"><i style="width: 66.66666666666667%;"></i></span><span class="pct">33.2%</span><span class="chg"><span class="flat">n/a</span></span></div><div class="mrow"><span class="lab" title="News">News <span>67</span></span><span class="track"><i style="width: 33.83838383838384%;"></i></span><span class="pct">16.9%</span><span class="chg"><span class="flat">n/a</span></span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section"><h2>Themes</h2><div class="card" data-export-block=""><div class="cardHead"><h3>Keyword themes</h3><span class="meta">Size = share of results</span></div><div class="cardBody"><div class="cloud" aria-label="Keyword themes"><span style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(255, 68, 68);" title="cloud harbor: 6.3% of results">cloud harbor</span><span style="font-size: 32px; color: rgb(96, 255, 128);" title="apple orchard: 25.0% of results">apple orchard</span><span style="font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 252, 96);" title="river stone: 12.5% of results">river stone</span></div><div class="key"><span><i style="background: rgb(96, 255, 128);"></i>Mostly positive</span><span><i style="background: rgb(255, 252, 96);"></i>Mostly neutral</span><span><i style="background: rgb(255, 68, 68);"></i>Mostly negative</span></div></div></div></section><section class="section"><h2>Top influencers</h2><div class="grid g4"><div class="ov" data-export-block=""><p class="t">Most active author</p><p class="who">AuthorA</p><p class="net">instagram</p><p class="val">12 results</p></div><div class="ov" data-export-block=""><p class="t">Most influential author</p><p class="who">AuthorB</p><p class="net">reddit</p><p class="val">3.4K reach</p></div><div class="ov" data-export-block=""><p class="t">Most active site</p><p class="who">site-a.example</p><p class="net">news</p><p class="val">9 results</p></div><div class="ov" data-export-block=""><p class="t">Most influential site</p><p class="who">site-b.example</p><p class="net">news</p><p class="val">45.0K reach</p></div></div><div class="card" data-export-block=""><div class="cardHead"><h3>Top 2 authors</h3><span class="meta">Posts, sentiment, reach and engagement</span></div><div class="cardBody"><div class="tableScroll"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Author</th><th>Network</th><th class="r">Posts</th><th class="r">vs Sep</th><th>Sentiment</th><th class="r">Reach</th><th class="r">Engagement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>Test Author One</b></td><td>Instagram</td><td class="r">6</td><td class="r"><span class="flat">new</span></td><td><span class="mini" role="img" aria-label="3 positive, 2 neutral, 1 negative"><i style="width: 50%; background: rgb(96, 255, 128);"></i><i style="width: 33.333333333333336%; background: rgb(255, 252, 96);"></i><i style="width: 16.666666666666668%; background: rgb(255, 68, 68);"></i></span></td><td class="r">5.0K</td><td class="r">121</td></tr><tr><td><b>Test Author Two</b></td><td>Reddit</td><td class="r">4</td><td class="r"><span class="flat">new</span></td><td><span class="mini" role="img" aria-label="1 positive, 1 neutral, 2 negative"><i style="width: 25%; background: rgb(96, 255, 128);"></i><i style="width: 25%; background: rgb(255, 252, 96);"></i><i style="width: 50%; background: rgb(255, 68, 68);"></i></span></td><td class="r">300</td><td class="r">8</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></section><p class="source">Source: Talkwalker export of the topic "Made Up Brand", October 1 to 31, 2026 (Eastern). Changes compare with the September report as presented to the client.</p></div></div>"`;

