export-block=""><p class="t">Most active site</p><p class="who">site-a.example</p><p class="net">news</p><p class="val">9 results</p></div><div class="ov" data-export-block=""><p class="t">Most influential site</p><p class="who">site-b.example</p><p class="net">news</p><p class="val">45.0K reach</p></div></div><div class="card" data-export-block=""><div class="cardHead"><h3>Top 2 authors</h3><span class="meta">Posts, sentiment, reach and engagement</span></div><div class="cardBody"><div class="tableScroll"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Author</th><th>Network</th><th class="r">Posts</th><th class="r">vs Sep</th><th>Sentiment</th><th class="r">Reach</th><th class="r">Engagement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>Test Author One</b></td><td>Instagram</td><td class="r">6</td><td class="r"><span class="flat">new</span></td><td><span class="mini" role="img" aria-label="3 positive, 2 neutral, 1 negative"><i style="width: 50%; background: rgb(96, 255, 128);"></i><i style="width: 33.333333333333336%; background: rgb(255, 252, 96);"></i><i style="width: 16.666666666666668%; background: rgb(255, 68, 68);"></i></span></td><td class="r">5.0K</td><td class="r">121</td></tr><tr><td><b>Test Author Two</b></td><td>Reddit</td><td class="r">4</td><td class="r"><span class="flat">new</span></td><td><span class="mini" role="img" aria-label="1 positive, 1 neutral, 2 negative"><i style="width: 25%; background: rgb(96, 255, 128);"></i><i style="width: 25%; background: rgb(255, 252, 96);"></i><i style="width: 50%; background: rgb(255, 68, 68);"></i></span></td><td class="r">300</td><td class="r">8</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="inCard"><div data-box="b-authors"></div></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="secHead"><h2>Most relevant posts</h2><span>Picked by the analyst. Approved posts are shown to the client, at most 12 a month.</span></div><div class="pgroup" data-export-block=""><div class="pgroupHead"><div><h3>Social posts <span>(0)</span></h3>